<title>COLOMBIA: Colombia's Monomeros Q1 net up 173.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Colombia's Monomeros Q1 net up 173.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombia's largest chemical company, Monomeros Colombo-Venezolanos, reported the following first quarter results, the securities superintendency said Tuesday:</p>
<p>Net 2.26 billion pesos vs 826 million</p>
<p>Assets 246.2 billion pesos vs 216.2 billion</p>
<p>Operating income 62.2 billion pesos vs 54.8 billion</p>
<p>((--Karl Penhaul, Bogota Newsroom, 571 610 7944))</p>
</text>
